{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-448090-r4518991","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Parson's Sauce (Hartshorne)","sourcePageId":448090,"sourceRevision":"4518991","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T17:19:52Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Parson's%20Sauce%20(Hartshorne)&oldid=4518991","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:20:09.094Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Household Cyclopedia sauce recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cucumber","Category:Recipes using cucumber pickles","Category:Recipes using ketchup","Category:Recipes using lemon","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"331c0037dc5693a1bc6abe47f84a4ee64b91f9a97541f6b1e7b0f0ec109980e5","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Sauce recipes\n| Yield = 500 ml|time=30 minutes|difficulty=2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Sauces|Sauces]]\n\n'''Parson's sauce''' is a light [[Cookbook:Sauces|sauce]] that can be used for a number of chicken and vegetable dishes. This recipe is an interpreted method from the original recipe in Henry Hartshorne's the Household Cyclopedia.<ref>{{cite book |last=Hartshorne |first=Henry |author-link= |date=1881 |title=The Household Cyclopedia |url=https://archive.org/details/Household_Cyclopedia/mode/2up |location= |publisher= |page=321 |isbn=}}</ref> \n\n==Ingredients==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]], zest removed\n* 2–3 pickled [[Cookbook:Cucumber|cucumbers]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 tsp [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n* 20 g [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|plain flour]]\n* 2 tsp catsup ([[Cookbook:Ketchup|ketchup]]) \n\n==Procedure==\n# [[Cookbook:Chopping|Chop]] lemon-peel and pickled cucumbers very fine. Mix in all remaining ingredients.\n# Transfer to a [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] for 10–15 minutes.\n# Use or serve.\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n[[Category:Recipes for sauces and condiments]]\n[[Category:Household Cyclopedia sauce recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber pickles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ketchup]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Parson's Sauce (Hartshorne)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 lemon, zest removed","sourceText":"1 lemon, zest removed","amountText":"1 lemon, zest removed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2–3 pickled cucumbers","sourceText":"2–3 pickled cucumbers","amountText":"2–3 pickled cucumbers","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tbsp butter","sourceText":"2 tbsp butter","amountText":"2 tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 tsp salt","sourceText":"1 tsp salt","amountText":"1 tsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line